字叔平。鈞生豫章太守量，字公度。量生潁川太守儁，字元異。儁生京兆尹防，字建公。帝即防之第二子也。少有奇節，聰朗多大略，博學洽聞，伏膺儒教。漢末大亂，常慨然有憂天下心。南陽太守同郡楊俊名知人，<ref>南陽太守同郡楊俊　「南陽」，各本皆作「南郡」。錢大昕《廿二史考異》{{*|以下簡稱考異}}：「魏志俊為南陽太守，非南郡。」今據改。</ref>見帝，未弱冠，以為非常之器。尚書清河崔琰與帝兄朗善，亦謂朗曰：「君弟聰亮明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」","raw_quote_sha256":"5575da666f9e169c2b0750e72d4cfc9419bd35cd77758dc9e36bd77c0396ef6b","selected_text_sha256":"c423833b1b98943bb19918e6ed6564f4d5c90ad401b61f8fa4f2fc20abd95026","begin_anchor":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝","end_anchor":"明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」"}],"removed_apparatus":[{"text_layer":"later_critical_apparatus","source_line":11,"raw_note":"南陽太守同郡楊俊　「南陽」，各本皆作「南郡」。錢大昕《廿二史考異》{{*|以下簡稱考異}}：「魏志俊為南陽太守，非南郡。」今據改。","raw_note_sha256":"513ca7dcf0235998e3ab2871e1ba0f3821ae3c017af3c9a2e3e7a8acff1ed2b3","scope":"digital_note_reports_yangjun_commandery_variant","collated_by_current_agent":false}]}}},{"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-015","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan","source":{"title":"《三國志》卷十五裴松之注引司馬彪序傳（完整一注）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B715&oldid=2085075","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B715&oldid=2085075","revision_id":2085075,"accessed_on":"2026-10-19","extent":"只收完整裴注引司馬彪序傳，不把古注冒作陳壽正文或整篇司馬朗傳。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文與維基文庫數位轉錄；保留歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未核底本影像","wikitext_sha256":"14c5fdc791492f2d8ecf996874e797f53b25dd411419062d717890b8139befc0","response_sha256":"9bfbe44768bee70248329a8dd179831aecd911f8d9b66736b6b9cb24d959cc64","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"骑":"騎"},"extraction_note":"完整原段含正文和裴注存source-receipt；此章只抽完整司馬彪序傳引文，去注模板包裝及維基連結，骑→騎顯式轉換，未改爲、穎、雋等原字。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note","source_lines":[23,24],"raw_quote":"司馬彪序傳曰：朗祖父雋，字元異，博學好古，倜儻有大度。長八尺三寸，腰帶十圍，儀狀魁岸，與眾有異，鄉黨宗族咸景附焉。位至穎川太守。父防，字建公，性質直公方，雖閑居宴處，威儀不忒。雅好《[[漢書#列傳|漢書名臣列傳]]》，所諷誦者數十萬言。少仕州郡，歷官洛陽令、京兆尹，以年老轉拜骑都尉。養志閭巷，闔門自守。諸子雖冠成人，不命曰進不敢進，不命曰坐不敢坐，不指有所問不敢言，父子之間肅如也。年七十一，{{YL|建安二十四年}}終。有子八人，朗最長，次即晉宣皇帝也。","raw_quote_sha256":"9e1ba4f60dc189fdbd9bb251dffa5820c662c5d06ac55d8ac550fa3798bab28a","selected_text_sha256":"b6f80c3600d879ed65d5e13bac5e74effb44645f1d919c0ae015f4507b14fa45","begin_anchor":"司馬彪序傳曰：朗祖父雋，字元異，","end_anchor":"子八人，朗最長，次即晉宣皇帝也。"}]}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AA","representative_source_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AA","source_person_ids":["dkn_ge4_286_AA"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_A","source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu001-near-father-2","connection":"father","assembly_id":"family-sima-jun-near-ancestry","root_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}}
